---
title: "daily_team_stats_view (kintai-v3: Initial Schema)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_scan: scan attendances table
    q_scan --> q_join: JOIN users ON attendances.user_id = users.id
    q_join --> q_iter: for each (date, team_id, generation) group
    q_iter --> q_filter_in: filter type = 'in'
    q_filter_in --> q_count_distinct: COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) where type = 'in'
    q_count_distinct --> q_iter: next group
    q_count_distinct --> q_materialize: all groups processed
    q_materialize --> [*]: materialized view populated

    note right of q_scan
        INV-001: View aggregates by (date, team_id, generation) - three-dimensional grouping
        INV-002: Only 'in' type attendance records are counted (clock-in events)
        INV-003: COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) prevents double-counting users with multiple clock-ins
    end note

    note right of q_materialize
        INV-004: Materialized view requires explicit REFRESH to update
        INV-005: No automatic refresh trigger defined - stale data risk if not refreshed
        INV-006: No indexes defined on the materialized view
    end note
